{"path":".agents/skills/vitadeck-vdapp-upload/SKILL.md","ref":"70e9ba2bb5603104bab02541ecf29a039796344b","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":1,"text":"---"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":2,"text":"name: vitadeck-vdapp-upload"},{"sha":"f9245aa2c3cc6170b360f82f73fbcd747a3f88f4","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793423976,"line":3,"text":"description: Uploads a Deck App Runtime Upload Archive (.vdapp.zip) to a Vita running VitaDeck over LAN. Use when the user asks to upload, publish, or deploy a vdapp to Vita/PSVita, push a deck app to hardware, curl a .vdapp.zip to the LAN Listener, or run `vitadeck dev` to rebuild and upload on every save."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":4,"text":"---"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":5,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":6,"text":"# VitaDeck vdapp upload"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":7,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":8,"text":"## Prerequisite"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":9,"text":""},{"sha":"f9245aa2c3cc6170b360f82f73fbcd747a3f88f4","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793423976,"line":10,"text":"VitaDeck must be running on the Vita. It listens from startup and serves `POST /upload` on port **8787** (falls forward through 8796 if busy; the Shell shows the bound URL under **Upload and link**, pass its port with `--port`). Turning **Upload and link** off in the Shell stops it until it is turned back on or VitaDeck restarts."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":12,"text":"## Preferred: `vitadeck dev`"},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"f9245aa2c3cc6170b360f82f73fbcd747a3f88f4","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793423976,"line":14,"text":"From the Deck App root, pass the URL shown under **Upload and link** in the Shell:"},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":15,"text":""},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":16,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":17,"text":"npx @vitadeck/sdk dev http://192.168.1.50:8787/   # or `vitadeck dev` inside this repo"},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":18,"text":"```"},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":19,"text":""},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":20,"text":"It builds with `--dev`, uploads, then rebuilds and re-uploads on every save, printing one line per upload (`installed myapp.vdapp 0.1.0` or `422 invalid_package: …`). Activate the app once in the Shell; later uploads replace it and restart it. Ctrl-C stops."},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":21,"text":""},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":22,"text":"## Fallback: upload a built archive"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":24,"text":"From any directory, upload a built archive:"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":26,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"c7e17ffcf6337f1dc70ce7828c3f521901430ead","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868290,"line":27,"text":"/path/to/vitadeck/.agents/skills/vitadeck-vdapp-upload/scripts/upload-vdapp.sh /path/to/myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":28,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":29,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":30,"text":"Success looks like: `{\"ok\":true,\"packageName\":\"myapp.vdapp\",\"version\":\"0.1.0\"}`"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":32,"text":"## Build the archive (if needed)"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":34,"text":"Inside a Deck App project (this repo or elsewhere):"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":36,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":37,"text":"vitadeck build"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":38,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":39,"text":""},{"sha":"0ec520145e1ff4657a25cec36682c2b86f5e6c15","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793253709,"line":40,"text":"Produces `<outDir>/<name>.vdapp/` and `<outDir>/<name>.vdapp.zip` (e.g. `dist/chat.vdapp.zip`). Use the **`.zip`**, not the unpacked folder. A project with a Host Control Plugin also writes `<name>.vdplugin.zip`; that one is never uploaded to the Vita, it is installed on the computer with `vitadeck-host-companion install` (see [vitadeck-host-control](../vitadeck-host-control/SKILL.md))."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":41,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":42,"text":"## Vita IP"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":43,"text":""},{"sha":"bfc69a2deef943e621a0150aa4f82f978ea96f70","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936636,"line":44,"text":"Pass `--ip`, or set `PSVITAIP` (the same variable the Vita `upload_vita` / `upload_vpk` CMake targets read):"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":45,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":46,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":47,"text":"upload-vdapp.sh --ip 192.168.1.50 myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":48,"text":"# or"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":49,"text":"PSVITAIP=192.168.1.50 upload-vdapp.sh myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":50,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":51,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":52,"text":"## Manual curl"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":53,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":54,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"bfc69a2deef943e621a0150aa4f82f978ea96f70","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936636,"line":55,"text":"curl -X POST \"http://${PSVITAIP}:8787/upload\" \\"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":56,"text":"  -F archive=@/path/to/myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":57,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":58,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":59,"text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":60,"text":""},{"sha":"f9245aa2c3cc6170b360f82f73fbcd747a3f88f4","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793423976,"line":61,"text":"- **Connection refused** — wrong IP, VitaDeck not running, or **Upload and link** turned off in the Shell."},{"sha":"ce57dc0f9e639672460f23bf80c63dd4349e978f","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792936652,"line":62,"text":"- **409** — Another upload in progress; wait and retry (`dev` retries once, then on the next save)."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":63,"text":"- **422** — Bad archive layout; zip must contain exactly one top-level `*.vdapp` directory."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":64,"text":"- After upload, pick the package on **Shell Home Screen** (Enter) if it did not become active automatically."}]}
